  "details": "I think VRChat should send players a notification when a group changes their name, (for example like Facebook does with pages), this will notify a user if a group they're in has been changed, because often groups get hacked, sold, or changed to something else. Several times I have found groups on my profile that I never joined, because they got changed into something completely different than what it was before, usually changed to a crypto scam or a dating server.",
